# {{ project_name }}

A C++26 project on [core2](https://github.com/efvincent/core2) (Orthodox / Handmade C++: modules, no C++ standard library, no exceptions or RTTI), generated from core2-template{% if ui == "imgui" %} with Dear ImGui ({{ imgui_backend }}){% elif ui != "plain" %} with {{ ui }}{% endif %}.

